            <span> Despliegue de <code class="text-slate-100">&lt;picture&gt;</code> con <code class="text-emerald-400">image/avif</code> y <code class="text-emerald-400">image/webp</code> + fallback JPEG y compresión perceptual con pérdida balanceada (<code class="text-slate-200">q=80</code>).</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800">
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-400">2. Resolución adaptativa (DPR):</span>
            <span> Mapeo de densidad mediante descriptores <code class="text-emerald-400">360w, 540w, 720w, 1080w</code> en <code class="text-slate-100">srcset</code> y <code class="text-slate-100">sizes="(max-width: 480px) 92vw, 420px"</code>.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800">
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-400">3. Prevención de Layout Shifts (CLS = 0):</span>
            <span> Reserva intrínseca con atributos <code class="text-emerald-400">width="700" height="933"</code> y CSS <code class="text-emerald-400">aspect-ratio: 3 / 4</code> + <code class="text-slate-200">contain: layout paint</code>.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800">
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-400">4. Priorización Critical Path (LCP):</span>
            <span> <code class="text-emerald-400">&lt;link rel="preload" as="image" fetchpriority="high"&gt;</code> + <code class="text-slate-100">loading="eager"</code> en el candidato LCP (#1); <code class="text-slate-100">loading="lazy" fetchpriority="low"</code> below-the-fold.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800">
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-400">5. Decodificación asíncrona:</span>
            <span> Directiva <code class="text-emerald-400">decoding="async"</code> en todas las imágenes para desacoplar el hilo principal.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800">
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-400">6. Mitigación de latencia percibida:</span>
            <span> Inyección de placeholders ligeros (<code class="text-emerald-400">LQIP Data URI</code> + color dominante extraído <code class="text-slate-200">#0f172a</code>).</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800">
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-400">7. Entrega distribuida y transformaciones Edge:</span>
            <span> Transformaciones dinámicas al vuelo (<code class="text-emerald-400">/cdn-cgi/image/format=...,quality=...,width=...</code>) y negociación de formato en Edge CDN.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800">
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-400">8. Caché inmutable y Content Addressing:</span>
            <span> Llaves R2 versionadas por hash SHA-256 (<code class="text-emerald-400">drops/v1/&lt;sha256&gt;-700x933.webp</code>) + <code class="text-slate-100">Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable</code>.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800">
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-400">9. Pipeline de ingesta desacoplado:</span>
            <span> Carga directa mediante <code class="text-emerald-400">S3 API Presigned URLs (AWS SigV4)</code> generadas por la Edge Function <code class="text-slate-100">/functions/v1/r2-presigned-upload</code>.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800">
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-400">10. Validación de seguridad en backend:</span>
            <span> Verificación de firmas binarias (<code class="text-emerald-400">Magic Bytes</code>: JPEG, PNG, WebP, AVIF), sanitización XML contra XSS en SVGs y depuración 100% de metadatos <code class="text-emerald-400">EXIF/GPS</code>.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800">
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-400">11. Aceleración por hardware en interfaz:</span>
            <span> Contenedores táctiles con <code class="text-emerald-400">CSS Scroll Snap</code>, <code class="text-slate-100">touch-action: pan-y pinch-zoom</code> y promoción de capa GPU (<code class="text-slate-100">translate3d(0,0,0)</code>).</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800">
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-400">12. Cumplimiento semántico y a11y:</span>
            <span> Atributos <code class="text-emerald-400">alt</code> contextualizados en fotos informativas vs <code class="text-slate-100">aria-hidden="true"</code> en decorativos y contraste WCAG AAA en superposiciones.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800">
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-400">13. Resiliencia y degradación grácil:</span>
            <span> Captura asíncrona de eventos <code class="text-emerald-400">error</code> con reemplazo automático por fallback vectorial SVG sin romper el layout y adaptación a <code class="text-slate-100">Save-Data</code>.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Script de datos de productos inyectado para el cliente -->
    <script id="catalog-data" type="application/json" set:html={JSON.stringify(products)}></script>

    <!-- ============================================================== -->
    <!-- CLIENT SCRIPT (Astro optimiza y empaqueta con Vite)            -->
    <!-- Buenas prácticas: Cero `onclick`, delegación limpia y eventos   -->
    <!-- ============================================================== -->
    <script>
      type SizeKey = 'S' | 'M' | 'L' | 'XL';

      interface ProductMeasurements {
        S: string;
        M: string;
        L: string;
        XL: string;
      }

      interface ProductImageMeta {
        url: string;
        r2ObjectKey?: string;
        contentHash?: string;
        dominantColor?: string;
        lqipDataUri?: string;
        exifStripped?: boolean;
        magicBytesVerified?: boolean;
      }

      interface ProductItem {
        id: number;
        slug: string;
        name: string;
        price: string;
        numericPrice: number;
        category: string;
        tag: string;
        fit: string;
        modelInfo: string;
        stockLeft: number;
        images: string[];
        imageMeta?: ProductImageMeta[];
        measurements: ProductMeasurements;
        availableSizes?: Record<SizeKey, boolean>;
        specs: string[];
        currentSlide?: number;
        selectedSize?: SizeKey | null;
      }

      const DEFAULT_WHATSAPP_NUMBER = '5215500000000';
      const DEFAULT_INSTAGRAM_URL = 'https://instagram.com/direct/inbox/';
      const STORE_CONFIG_CACHE_KEY = 'urban_drop_store_config_v1';
      const SAVE_DATA_STORAGE_KEY = 'urban_drop_save_data_mode';
      const SESSION_STORAGE_KEY = 'urban_drop_jwt_session_v1';
      const ALL_SIZES: SizeKey[] = ['S', 'M', 'L', 'XL'];
      const SUPABASE_URL = 'https://zbdblhlaacxewkxvlufs.supabase.co';
      const SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY = 'sb_publishable_0oXCTZq-eeth1wnZI6b7wQ_ZCZdltsC';
      const INTRINSIC_WIDTH = 700;
      const INTRINSIC_HEIGHT = 933;
      const CARD_SIZES_ATTR = '(max-width: 480px) 92vw, 420px';

      function isAdminSessionActive(): boolean {
        try {
          const raw =
            sessionStorage.getItem(SESSION_STORAGE_KEY) ||
            localStorage.getItem(SESSION_STORAGE_KEY);
          if (!raw) return false;
          const parsed = JSON.parse(raw);
          if (!parsed || typeof parsed.access_token !== 'string') return false;
          const parts = parsed.access_token.split('.');
          if (parts.length !== 3) return false;
          const base64 = parts[1].replace(/-/g, '+').replace(/_/g, '/');
          const padded = base64 + '='.repeat((4 - (base64.length % 4)) % 4);
          const payload = JSON.parse(atob(padded));
          const nowSec = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);
          if (!payload || typeof payload.exp !== 'number' || payload.exp <= nowSec) {
            return false;
          }
          const role = payload?.app_metadata?.role || payload?.role;
          return role === 'admin_drop';
        } catch {
          return false;
        }
      }

      function applyAdminTechnicalVisibility(): boolean {
        const isAdmin = isAdminSessionActive();
        document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-admin-only]').forEach((el) => {
          const displayMode = el.getAttribute('data-admin-only') || 'inline-flex';
          if (isAdmin) {
            el.classList.remove('hidden');
            el.classList.add(displayMode);
          } else {
            el.classList.add('hidden');
            el.classList.remove('flex', 'inline-flex', 'block');
          }
        });

        const saveDataIndicator = document.getElementById('save-data-banner-indicator');
        if (saveDataIndicator && !isAdmin) {
          saveDataIndicator.classList.add('hidden');
        }

        const navLoginLink = document.getElementById('nav-login-link');
        if (navLoginLink) {
          navLoginLink.setAttribute(
            'title',
            isAdmin
              ? 'Sesión Admin Activa (Ver Panel Admin)'
              : 'Acceso Administrativo'
          );
        }

        if (!isAdmin) {
          document.getElementById('ux-info-modal')?.classList.add('opacity-0', 'pointer-events-none');
          document.getElementById('r2-pipeline-modal')?.classList.add('opacity-0', 'pointer-events-none');
        }
        return isAdmin;
      }

      window.addEventListener('storage', () => {
        applyAdminTechnicalVisibility();
      });

      // Fallback vectorial SVG resiliente ante fallos de red (Pilar 13)
      const SVG_FALLBACK_DATA_URI =
        'data:image/svg+xml;utf8,' +
        encodeURIComponent(
          `<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 700 933" width="700" height="933">` +
            `<defs><linearGradient id="g" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">` +
            `<stop offset="0%" stop-color="#0f172a"/><stop offset="50%" stop-color="#1e1b4b"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#020617"/>` +
            `</linearGradient></defs>` +
            `<rect width="700" height="933" fill="url(#g)"/>` +
            `<g fill="none" stroke="#ec4899" stroke-width="3" opacity="0.55">` +
            `<rect x="190" y="290" width="320" height="320" rx="32"/>` +
            `<path d="M240 530 L315 445 L375 505 L425 455 L465 530 Z"/>` +
            `<circle cx="300" cy="375" r="24"/>` +
            `</g>` +
            `<text x="350" y="665" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f8fafc" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="22" font-weight="bold">URBAN_DROP • EDGE FALLBACK</text>` +
            `<text x="350" y="698" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-family="monospace" font-size="15">Cloudflare R2 Resilient Vector Placeholder</text>` +
          `</svg>`
        );

      function createClientLqipDataUri(primaryColor = '#0f172a', accentColor = '#1e1b4b'): string {
        const svg =
          `<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 30 40" preserveAspectRatio="none">` +
          `<defs><linearGradient id="b" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">` +
          `<stop offset="0%" stop-color="${primaryColor}"/>` +
          `<stop offset="60%" stop-color="${accentColor}"/>` +
          `<stop offset="100%" stop-color="#020617"/>` +
          `</linearGradient></defs>` +
          `<rect width="30" height="40" fill="url(#b)"/>` +
          `</svg>`;
        return `data:image/svg+xml;utf8,${encodeURIComponent(svg)}`;
      }

      function detectClientSaveData(): boolean {
        try {
          if (localStorage.getItem(SAVE_DATA_STORAGE_KEY) === '1') return true;
          if (localStorage.getItem(SAVE_DATA_STORAGE_KEY) === '0') return false;
          const conn = (navigator as any).connection || (navigator as any).mozConnection || (navigator as any).webkitConnection;
          if (conn && conn.saveData === true) return true;
        } catch {
          // ignore
        }
        return false;
      }

      function buildEdgeUrl(rawUrl: string, width: number, format: 'avif' | 'webp' | 'jpeg', quality: number): string {
        if (!rawUrl) return SVG_FALLBACK_DATA_URI;
        if (rawUrl.startsWith('data:') || rawUrl.startsWith('blob:')) return rawUrl;
        const height = Math.round((width * INTRINSIC_HEIGHT) / INTRINSIC_WIDTH);
        try {
          const parsed = new URL(rawUrl);
          if (parsed.hostname.includes('images.unsplash.com')) {
            parsed.searchParams.set('auto', 'format');
            parsed.searchParams.set('fit', 'crop');
            parsed.searchParams.set('w', String(width));
            parsed.searchParams.set('h', String(height));
            parsed.searchParams.set('q', String(quality));
            parsed.searchParams.set('fm', format === 'jpeg' ? 'jpg' : format);
            return parsed.toString();
          }
          parsed.searchParams.set('cf_fmt', format);
          parsed.searchParams.set('cf_w', String(width));
          parsed.searchParams.set('cf_h', String(height));
          parsed.searchParams.set('cf_q', String(quality));
          return parsed.toString();
        } catch {
          return rawUrl;
        }
      }

      function buildResponsiveSources(rawUrl: string, saveData = false) {
        const widths = saveData ? [360, 540] : [360, 540, 720, 1080];
        const avifQ = saveData ? 52 : 78;
        const webpQ = saveData ? 56 : 80;
        const jpgQ = saveData ? 60 : 82;
        const defaultW = saveData ? 540 : 700;

        return {
          avifSrcset: widths.map((w) => `${buildEdgeUrl(rawUrl, w, 'avif', avifQ)} ${w}w`).join(', '),
          webpSrcset: widths.map((w) => `${buildEdgeUrl(rawUrl, w, 'webp', webpQ)} ${w}w`).join(', '),
          fallbackSrc: buildEdgeUrl(rawUrl, defaultW, 'jpeg', jpgQ),
          sizes: CARD_SIZES_ATTR,
        };
      }

      // Captura global asíncrona de errores de red en imágenes (Pilar 13: Resiliencia y Degradación Grácil)
      window.addEventListener(
        'error',
        (event: ErrorEvent) => {
          const target = event.target as HTMLElement | null;
          if (!target || target.tagName !== 'IMG') return;
          const img = target as HTMLImageElement;
          if (img.dataset.fallbackApplied === 'true') return;
          img.dataset.fallbackApplied = 'true';
          const picture = img.closest('picture');
          if (picture) {
            picture.querySelectorAll('source').forEach((s) => s.removeAttribute('srcset'));
          }
          img.removeAttribute('srcset');
          img.src = SVG_FALLBACK_DATA_URI;
          img.style.opacity = '1';
        },
        true
      );

      // 1. Inicialización y Carga de Datos
      const rawData = document.getElementById('catalog-data')?.textContent;
      const productsList: ProductItem[] = rawData ? JSON.parse(rawData) : [];

      const CART_STORAGE_KEY = 'urban_drop_cart_v1';

      interface CartItem {
        key: string;
        productId: number;
        size: SizeKey;
        qty: number;
      }

      const state = {
        products: new Map<number, ProductItem>(),
        savedProductIds: new Set<number>(),
        cartItems: new Map<string, CartItem>(),
        activeCategory: 'todos',
        searchQuery: '',
        activeProductId: 1,
        activeSocialChannel: 'whatsapp' as 'whatsapp' | 'instagram',
        activeRedirectUrl: '',
        activeMessageText: '',
        isMultiOrderSocial: false,
        whatsappNumber: DEFAULT_WHATSAPP_NUMBER,
        instagramActive: true,
        instagramUrl: DEFAULT_INSTAGRAM_URL,
        saveDataActive: detectClientSaveData(),
      };

      // Cargar configuración social en caché local si existe mientras responde Supabase
      try {
        const cachedCfg = localStorage.getItem(STORE_CONFIG_CACHE_KEY);
        if (cachedCfg) {
          const parsed = JSON.parse(cachedCfg);
          if (parsed.whatsappNumber) state.whatsappNumber = String(parsed.whatsappNumber);
          if (typeof parsed.instagramActive === 'boolean') state.instagramActive = parsed.instagramActive;
          if (parsed.instagramUrl) state.instagramUrl = String(parsed.instagramUrl);
        }
      } catch {
        // Ignorar error de lectura local
      }

      productsList.forEach((prod) => {
        prod.currentSlide = 0;
        prod.selectedSize = null;
        prod.availableSizes = prod.availableSizes || { S: true, M: true, L: true, XL: true };
        state.products.set(prod.id, prod);
      });

      function updatePictureElementForProduct(productId: number, rawUrl: string, altText: string) {
        const sources = buildResponsiveSources(rawUrl, state.saveDataActive);
        const avifSource = document.querySelector<HTMLSourceElement>(`[data-source-avif="${productId}"]`);
        const webpSource = document.querySelector<HTMLSourceElement>(`[data-source-webp="${productId}"]`);
        const imgEl = document.querySelector<HTMLImageElement>(`[data-img-product="${productId}"]`);

        if (avifSource) {
          avifSource.srcset = sources.avifSrcset;
          avifSource.sizes = sources.sizes;
        }
        if (webpSource) {
          webpSource.srcset = sources.webpSrcset;
          webpSource.sizes = sources.sizes;
        }
        if (imgEl) {
          delete imgEl.dataset.fallbackApplied;
          imgEl.srcset = sources.webpSrcset;
          imgEl.sizes = sources.sizes;
          imgEl.src = sources.fallbackSrc;
          imgEl.alt = altText;
        }
      }

      function applySaveDataUI() {
        const isAdmin = isAdminSessionActive();
        const indicator = document.getElementById('save-data-banner-indicator');
        const headerPill = document.getElementById('r2-header-pill-text');
        const descEl = document.getElementById('r2-save-data-desc');
        const toggleBtn = document.getElementById('toggle-save-data-btn');

        if (indicator) {
          indicator.classList.toggle('hidden', !state.saveDataActive || !isAdmin);
        }
        if (headerPill) {
          headerPill.textContent = state.saveDataActive ? 'R2•LITE' : 'R2•AVIF';
        }
        if (descEl) {
          descEl.innerHTML = state.saveDataActive
            ? 'Activo (<code class="text-amber-300">Save-Data: on</code>): sirviendo <code class="text-amber-300">360w, 540w</code> comprimidos (<code class="text-amber-300">q=52 AVIF</code>).'
            : 'Desactivado: sirviendo <code class="text-emerald-400">360w, 540w, 720w, 1080w</code> (<code class="text-emerald-400">q=78-80 AVIF/WebP</code>).';
        }
        if (toggleBtn) {
          toggleBtn.textContent = state.saveDataActive ? 'Desactivar Save-Data' : 'Activar Save-Data';
        }

        // Actualizar todas las tarjetas con la nueva densidad/calidad
        state.products.forEach((prod) => {
          const slideIdx = prod.currentSlide ?? 0;
          const currentUrl = prod.images[slideIdx] || prod.images[0];
          const alt = `${prod.name} — Corte ${prod.fit} (${prod.tag}) — Vista ${slideIdx + 1} de ${prod.images.length}`;
          updatePictureElementForProduct(prod.id, currentUrl, alt);
        });
      }

      function applyStoreConfigToDOM() {
        const igButtons = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-channel="instagram"]');
        igButtons.forEach((btn) => {
          btn.classList.toggle('hidden', !state.instagramActive);
          btn.classList.toggle('flex', state.instagramActive);
